        "body": "In the gitbook `Options` chapter and `Option modifiers` section, the table has its right side hidden, not displaying in full. The screenshot shows this behavior. \r\nNote: I've tried Firefox 80 and Chrome 85 on MacOS 10.14.6, and it displays the same. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1450\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2020-08-27 at 5 14 57 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/814885/91504098-64f28380-e889-11ea-9a4c-5f0dddf0a81e.png\">\r\n",
